const float sim_cur    = float(lcp_cur) / tokens_new.size();   // fraction of new prompt matched

// BOTH must be better, and f_keep must exceed 25% threshold
if (f_keep_cur > f_keep_best && sim_cur > sim_best && f_keep_cur > 0.25f) {
    it_best = it;
    f_keep_best = f_keep_cur;
    sim_best = sim_cur;
}
```

**Limits:**
| Constraint | Value | Location |
|---|---|---|
| Size limit | `--cache-ram N` MiB, LRU eviction when exceeded | `server-task.cpp:1750` |
| Token limit | `n_ctx` (slot context size) | `server-task.cpp:626` |
| Minimum f_keep for load | 0.25 (25% of cached context must be preserved) | `server-task.cpp:1708` |
| Multimodal support | **NOT supported** — `has_mtmd` blocks chunk reuse | `server-context.cpp:2851` |
| Speculative draft state | Saved/restored alongside main state | `server-context.cpp:149-151` |

