| Mechanism | Scope | Storage | Multimodal | Draft State | User-Controlled |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Prompt Cache** (A) | Cross-slot, RAM | RAM (LRU) | ❌ No | ✅ Saved | `--cache-ram` |
| **Slot Save/Restore** (B) | Single slot, disk | Disk file | ❌ No | ❌ Not saved | `POST /slots/{id}` |
| **Speculative Checkpoints** (C) | Single slot, internal | RAM (slot-owned) | ❌ No | ✅ Saved | Internal only |
| **Chunk Reuse** (D) | Single slot, in-place | KV cache shift | ❌ No | N/A | Per-request param |

